# ==================== WHATSAPP ALERTS (optional) ====================
# Same alerts jo Telegram pe jaate hain, WhatsApp pe bhi bhejta hai.
#
# SACH: WhatsApp pe "sirf number daalo aur message chala jaye" aisa koi free
# official API nahi hai. Har provider kuch na kuch maangta hai (apikey / token).
#
# Provider 1 - CallMeBot (FREE, no signup, no app):
#   1. CallMeBot ka WhatsApp number contacts me save karo.
#      Number unki site pe hai: https://www.callmebot.com/blog/free-api-whatsapp-messages/
#      (kabhi "bot is currently full" likha hota hai - us waqt number hidden rehta
#       hai, thode din baad try karo)
#   2. Us contact ko WhatsApp pe ye message bhejo (exact):
#         I allow callmebot to send me messages
#   3. Reply me apikey aayegi: "API Activated... Your APIKEY is 123456"
#   4. Wahi apikey WHATSAPP_APIKEY me daalo.
#   NOTE: CallMeBot sirf AAPKO (apne hi number pe) bhej sakta hai, doosron ko nahi.
#
# Provider 2 - Official Meta Cloud API (100% official, reliable, paid per message):
#   1. business.facebook.com -> Create Business portfolio (free)
#   2. developers.facebook.com -> My Apps -> Create App -> type "Business"
#      -> Add Product -> WhatsApp
#   3. API Setup page: free TEST number milta hai (5 recipients tak free, no payment method).
#      Phone Number ID copy karo, temporary token (24h) copy karo, apna number verify karo.
#   4. Production ke liye: Business Settings -> System Users -> Generate token
#      (permission: whatsapp_business_messaging). 24h token production me kaam nahi karega.
#   5. IMPORTANT: Meta ka rule - business free-form text sirf 24-HOUR WINDOW ke andar bhej
#      sakta hai. Window tab khulta hai jab AAP us business number ko message karo.
#      Window band hone par APPROVED TEMPLATE chahiye, warna error 131047 aata hai.
#      Template: WhatsApp Manager -> Account tools -> Message templates -> Create
#        Name: crypto_alert   Category: Utility   Language: English
#        Body:
#          🚨 {{1}} ALERT
#          {{2}}
#          {{3}}
#          Impact: {{4}}
#          Source: {{5}}
#      (exact 5 placeholders isi order me - code inhi me category/headline/summary/impact/source daalta hai)
#   6. India rate (Oct 2026): utility template ~Rs 0.115 per message.
#      20 alerts/day = ~Rs 70/month. Window ke andar text free (1000/month tak).
WHATSAPP_ENABLED=false
WHATSAPP_PROVIDER=callmebot
WHATSAPP_PHONE=91XXXXXXXXXX
WHATSAPP_APIKEY=tumhara_apikey_yahan
# WHATSAPP_PROVIDER=cloudapi
# WHATSAPP_CLOUD_TOKEN=tumhara_meta_token
# WHATSAPP_CLOUD_PHONE_ID=test_number_ka_phone_id
# Mode: auto (text pehle, window band ho to template) | text | template
# WHATSAPP_CLOUD_MODE=auto
# WHATSAPP_CLOUD_TEMPLATE=crypto_alert
# WHATSAPP_CLOUD_TEMPLATE_LANG=en
# ==================== PROVIDER 3 (SABSE BADA JUGAAD - FREE + NO 24x7 PC) ====================
# ABHI PAUSED: main.py me greenapi dispatch comment out hai, isliye provider=greenapi
# set karne par bhi kuch send nahi hoga. Chalu karna ho to send_whatsapp_message()
# me 3 lines wapas uncomment karo (wahan note likha hai).
# Green API "Developer" plan - 100% FREE:
#   - 1 instance, sirf 3 chats tak (personal alert ke liye kaafi)
#   - sendMessage UNLIMITED
#   - WhatsApp session Green API ke SERVER pe rehta hai -> PC/phone 24x7 ON rakhne ki zarurat NAHI
#   - GitHub Actions se seedha HTTP API call -> QR dobara scan nahi karna padega
# Setup (10 min, ek hi baar):
#   1. green-api.com -> Start free / Console -> Google se login
#   2. Console -> "Create instance" -> plan = Developer (free)
#   3. "Scan QR" -> apne phone se WhatsApp -> Linked devices -> Link a device
#      (Spare number ho to better - ban risk kam)
#   4. Instance page se ID Instance aur ApiTokenInstance copy karo
#   5. .env / GitHub secrets me daalo (neeche 3 lines)
#   NOTE: Ye unofficial (WhatsApp Web) protocol hai. Sirf apne hi number ko message karo,
#         bulk/unknown numbers ko nahi -> ban risk kam rehta hai.
# WHATSAPP_PROVIDER=greenapi
# WHATSAPP_GREEN_ID=1101xxxxxxxx
# WHATSAPP_GREEN_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# WHATSAPP_PHONE=919876543210

# Provider 4 - Twilio WhatsApp Sandbox (PERSONAL number OK, no business account):
#   1. twilio.com pe free signup (trial credit milta hai)
#   2. Console -> Messaging -> Try it out -> Send a WhatsApp message -> Sandbox
#   3. Apne WhatsApp se sandbox number ko "join <code>" bhejo (code console me)
#   4. Account SID, Auth Token, aur sandbox From number copy karo
#   5. WHATSAPP_PROVIDER=twilio, WHATSAPP_PHONE=919876543210 (receiver)
#   NOTE: 72 ghante inactive raho to "join" dobara karna padta hai.
# WHATSAPP_TWILIO_SID=ACxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# WHATSAPP_TWILIO_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# WHATSAPP_TWILIO_FROM=whatsapp:+14155238886

# ==================== INSTANT PHONE PUSH via ntfy.sh (EASIEST - 2 min) ====================
# Na signup, na stranger number, na business account. Bas:
#   1. Play Store / App Store se "ntfy" app install karo
#   2. App me + dabake ye topic SUBSCRIBE karo (neeche wala naam exact)
#   3. .env / GitHub Secrets me NTFY_ENABLED=true + wahi topic daalo
# NOTE: ntfy WhatsApp nahi hai - ye normal phone notification hai. Par isme
# koi apikey / signup / number nahi chahiye, isliye ye sabse reliable free option hai.
NTFY_ENABLED=false
NTFY_TOPIC=CryptoRepo-m7k2x9pq

# ==================== TEST KARNE KA TARIKA ====================
# Har channel (Telegram + WhatsApp + ntfy) ek-ek test message bhej ke batata hai
# kaunsa chal raha hai aur kaunsa fail:
#   python main.py --test-alert
# GitHub pe: Actions tab -> "Test Alert" -> Run workflow

# Calendar download throttle (seconds) - 429 rate-limit se bachne ke liye, kam mat karo
# MACRO_FETCH_INTERVAL=3600